flickos-classroom-view (1.0~test9) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Phase 3a. Several teachers on a computer, up to 16, one connected at
    a time: a second takes over unless the first has a class lock, demo,
    view or control on, and a console taken over waits for its teacher
    (ADR-016, Q14); student/lab teachers and forget FINGERPRINT. The
    teacher's window shows one class at a time, here first and absent
    greyed, with Copy Attendance and Save Attendance… only when pressed,
    and Teacher Certificate… (ADR-017, Q16, Q17). The lab notice names
    the account logged in and shows once more (Q15). PRIVACY.md says
    what a teacher can see. Sockets shut down on close, so a taken-over
    session ends at once.

