flickos-classroom-view (1.0~test1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First version: the student agent (mDNS, TLS on port 47100, pairing
    by a six-digit code, thumbnails, class lock, message, web page) and
    the teacher's console (docs/design/flickos-classroom-view.md phase
    1).
  * Lab computers (ADR-011): lab on|off|pair|forget for the
    administrator, the root service flickos-classroom-lab.service that
    passes a teacher's session to the agent of whoever has the seat;
    every account shares and can't turn it off.
  * The first-run notice on a lab computer says the administrator set it
    up, not that the student can turn it off.

 -- Jon <dvbondoy@gmail.com>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:39:12 +0800
